>done. One, the spell should be more powerful, permanent(unlimited use), and av-
>ailable for magic users. But, to counter that, have metal armor absorb most
>of the magical energy and make effective/deadly spells difficult or
>impossible to cast.
I agree, for every metal weapon you wield and metal armor you wear, the spell
should take more magic points than usual.

Also getting magic energy should be much harder. At the moment is a potion of
magic energy the most worthless potion of the game. Give players only 1 magic
point in 5000 moves and even worse for people that carry metal. Make it
possible to take over the magic energy from a wizard corpse.

